      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e24d8d8115e4d2cb",
      "translationZh": "如果不喜欢 launcher ? 使用 bats 和 terminal serve。甚至可以使用 launcher 来配置你想要的内容，从右下角复制它并使用它来制作新的 bat。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6e222b97c6ab922",
      "translationZh": "它的要点就是仅 load model，fan out crazy number of agents，每个 agents 拥有 crazy amount of context，然后让 MC 来处理。你只需坐后放松，观看 agents 以 SOTA speeds 完成工作。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4dd3fc270d05374",
      "translationZh": "欢迎意见和评论。如果你拥有 RTX5090 请试试。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c71cbf71e3ac70fe",
      "translationZh": "源代码将稍后发布，我先要做一些清理工作。我还会稍后发布 weights builder，这样它就能接受任何 3.8 27B BF16 model，创建权重并为其打分，再次附加 BF16 元数据，你就能够自己在 hugginface 上托管它们，或者直接放进 models 文件夹。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35e97592860cc99d",
